<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιτός, ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίω
		Β</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>meal, banquet,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαὶς ἐΐση,</span>
			<i>duly shared,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.95
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαὶς πίειρα</span>
			sumptuous <i>banquet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				19.179
			</span></i>; <i>sacrificial feast,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμὸς ἐδεύετο δαιτὸς ἐΐσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.69
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαῖτα θάλειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hom.
				</span></i>
			<i>Fr.inc.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i> Kinkel (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.382
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θυέστου δαῖτα παιδείων κρεῶν</span>
			<i>the feast</i> of <i><span class="en">
				Th.
			</span></i> on . ., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1242
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1593
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.182
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				483
			</span></i>: of beasts of prey, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.43
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτοις] παρέξω δαῖθ᾽ ὑφ᾽ ὧν
					ἐφερβόμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					957
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>meat, food,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				245
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.279
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> personified,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				605
			</span></i>. Rare in Prose (exc. in Homeric allusions, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				247a
			</span></i>, etc.) as <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.133
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				211
			</span></i>.</div>
